{"seq":1,"slug":"svhc-01pct-threshold-scip","title":"0.1% 阈值判定与 SCIP 数据库通报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/restricted-substance-product-compliance/substance-threshold-assessment/svhc-01pct-threshold-scip","wordCount":2323,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"0-1-阈值判定与-scip-数据库通报\">0.1% 阈值判定与 SCIP 数据库通报</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>REACH 物质合规里唯一被反复引用的数字是 <strong>0.1% w/w</strong>，但它至少对应三种不同的法律后果：Article 33 的信息传递义务、Article 7(2) 的 ECHA 通报义务、以及《废弃物框架指令》下的 SCIP 数据库提交义务。三者共用同一个数量阈值，但<strong>各自的比较对象、触发条件、提交对象完全不同</strong>。把它们当成&quot;超过 0.1% 就都要做&quot;会导致两类错误：该做的没做（漏 SCIP），不该做的做了（对整机重算 Article 33）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SVHC 浓度 &gt; 0.1% w/w] --&gt; B{比较对象是谁}&#10;    B --&gt;|单个物品 article| C[Article 33 信息传递]&#10;    B --&gt;|单个物品 article| D[Article 7 2 ECHA 通报]&#10;    B --&gt;|复杂物品中最小的组成物品| E[SCIP 数据库提交]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[向下游/消费者&lt;br/&gt;45 天内答复]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[总量 &gt; 1 吨/年才触发]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[2021-01-05 起强制]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[按最底层物品粒度]\">graph TD\n    A[SVHC 浓度 &gt; 0.1% w/w] --&gt; B{比较对象是谁}\n    B --&gt;|单个物品 article| C[Article 33 信息传递]\n    B --&gt;|单个物品 article| D[Article 7 2 ECHA 通报]\n    B --&gt;|复杂物品中最小的组成物品| E[SCIP 数据库提交]\n    C --&gt; C1[向下游/消费者&lt;br/&gt;45 天内答复]\n    D --&gt; D1[总量 &gt; 1 吨/年才触发]\n    E --&gt; E1[2021-01-05 起强制]\n    E --&gt; E2[按最底层物品粒度]</pre><p>三条义务的法律依据与实施日期见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_Chemicals_Agency\">European Chemicals Agency</a>；阈值语义与候选清单规模见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Substance_of_very_high_concern\">Substance of very high concern</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三条义务的对照\">三条义务的对照</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Article 33 信息传递</th>\n<th>Article 7(2) ECHA 通报</th>\n<th>SCIP 数据库提交</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>法律依据</td>\n<td>REACH Article 33</td>\n<td>REACH Article 7(2)</td>\n<td>废弃物框架指令（2018/851 修订）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比较基准</td>\n<td>单个物品</td>\n<td>单个物品</td>\n<td>复杂物品中最小的组成物品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量门槛</td>\n<td>仅浓度 &gt;0.1%</td>\n<td>浓度 &gt;0.1% <strong>且</strong> 总量 &gt;1 吨/年</td>\n<td>浓度 &gt;0.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交对象</td>\n<td>下游接收方、消费者</td>\n<td>ECHA</td>\n<td>ECHA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>起始时间</td>\n<td>2007 起（2008 起适用）</td>\n<td>2011-06-01 起</td>\n<td><strong>2021-01-05</strong> 起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时限要求</td>\n<td>消费者请求 45 天内</td>\n<td>无对外时限</td>\n<td>投放市场前</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"0-1-的比较对象-复杂物品的递归拆分\">0.1% 的比较对象：复杂物品的递归拆分</h2><h3 id=\"物品-复杂物品与最小组成物品\">物品、复杂物品与最小组成物品</h3><p>先定义三个概念。<strong>物品</strong>（article）指在生产过程中被赋予特定形状、表面或设计的物体，其形状/表面/设计对其功能的影响大于其化学组成。<strong>复杂物品</strong>（complex object）由多个物品组装而成。<strong>最小组成物品</strong>是对复杂物品递归拆分到不能再用机械方式继续分离的层级。</p>\n<p>判定规则因此是递归的：拿到一台整机，先判断它是否由多个物品组成；是，就对每个子物品分别比对 0.1%；子物品若仍是复杂物品，继续拆。<strong>浓度基准始终是&quot;被考察的那个物品自身&quot;</strong>，绝不向上汇总为整机重量。</p>\n<p>三个概念混淆会造成的具体后果，用一台含电源线、塑料外壳、PCB 的电子设备说明：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拆分层级</th>\n<th>若按整机重量比较</th>\n<th>若按该层物品自身比较（正确）</th>\n<th>后果差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电源线（含增塑剂）</td>\n<td>稀释后可能 &lt;0.1%</td>\n<td>单独看可能 &gt;0.1%</td>\n<td>前者漏报，后者触发义务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>塑料外壳</td>\n<td>稀释后可能 &lt;0.1%</td>\n<td>单独看可能 &lt;0.1%</td>\n<td>一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焊点（含铅）</td>\n<td>稀释后极小</td>\n<td>单独看 &gt;0.1%</td>\n<td>前者严重漏报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按整机重量比较是<strong>系统性偏向漏报</strong>的错误，因为整机重量大概率远大于任何单一物品。这也是为什么监管会把&quot;按最底层物品粒度&quot;写进 SCIP 的技术要求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阈值运算的数学形式\">阈值运算的数学形式</h3><p>忽略密度差异、按质量分数运算时，判定可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>declared</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>substances</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{declared}(a) = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{substances}(a)} \\frac{m_i \\cdot c_i}{m_a} \\quad \\text{其中} \\quad m_a = \\sum_{i} m_i \\cdot c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">declared</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6375em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">substances</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1215em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对递归结构，物品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 中某物质的有效浓度可由其子物品递归求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>children</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>leaf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>declared concentration</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^{\\text{eff}}_{s}(a) = \\frac{\\sum_{b \\in \\text{children}(a)} m_b \\cdot c^{\\text{eff}}_{s}(b)}{m_a}, \\qquad c^{\\text{eff}}_{s}(\\text{leaf}) = \\text{declared concentration}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5498em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7138em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8647em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">children</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">leaf</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">declared concentration</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个递归式的工程含义是：<strong>同一份叶片层物质数据可以同时支撑多层判定</strong>（Article 33 看每一层，SCIP 看最底层，RoHS 看均质材料层），不需要为每个义务重新采集数据。这是把数据采集与义务判定分离的直接收益——采集规范见 <a href=\"../substance-data-bom/bom-substance-data-fmdi\">BOM 物质数据采集与 FMDI 材料声明</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH RECURSIVE article_tree AS (&#10;  SELECT a.article_id, a.parent_article_id, a.mass_g, 0 AS depth&#10;  FROM article a WHERE a.article_id = :root_article_id&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT c.article_id, c.parent_article_id, c.mass_g, p.depth + 1&#10;  FROM article c JOIN article_tree p ON c.parent_article_id = p.article_id&#10;),&#10;leaf_substance AS (&#10;  SELECT t.article_id, d.cas, d.concentration_pct_w_w AS c_leaf&#10;  FROM article_tree t&#10;  JOIN article_leaf_s a ON a.article_id = t.article_id&#10;  JOIN material_substance_declaration d ON d.material_id = a.material_id&#10;),&#10;rolled AS (&#10;  SELECT article_id, cas, c_leaf AS c_eff, 0 AS level FROM leaf_substance&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT p.parent_article_id, r.cas,&#10;         SUM(r.c_eff * c.mass_g) / NULLIF(p.mass_g, 0), r.level + 1&#10;  FROM rolled r&#10;  JOIN article p ON p.article_id = r.article_id&#10;  JOIN article c ON c.article_id = r.article_id&#10;  GROUP BY p.parent_article_id, r.cas, p.mass_g, r.level&#10;)&#10;SELECT article_id, cas, MAX(c_eff) AS c_eff_max&#10;FROM rolled&#10;WHERE c_eff &gt; 0.1&#10;GROUP BY article_id, cas;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> article_tree </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">article_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_article_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mass_g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> article a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">article_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :root_article_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">article_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_article_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mass_g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> article c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> article_tree p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span sty